<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 1.4 bln rand S.African bonds in '97.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 1.4 bln rand S.African bonds in '97.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners have already bought a net 1.4 billion rand South African bonds so far this year, underlying rowing confidence in the the market after a poor performance in 1996, latest figures show.</p>
<p>Bond Exchange of South Africa data up to Janaury 24:</p>
<p>Non-resident transactions (million rand):</p>
<p>				   Week to Jan 24  Year to date</p>
<p>    - purchases		6,175.48	 18,146.33</p>
<p>    - sales		    5,398.04	 16,755.55</p>
<p>    - net purchases (sales)  777.44	  1,390.78</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
